    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00062",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly names transplant immunosuppression, diabetes/insulin, and kidney/proteinuria history as high-risk context.",
          "quote": "目前血钾5.7属于轻度升高，肌酐轻度升高，加上血尿、蛋白尿，这些情况确实需要重视，但叔叔现在没有不舒服、尿量也正常，**不是必须立刻今晚急诊**，但必须马上联系原来的肝移植随访团队或者门诊医生，让他们评估，因为这些异常和肝移植术后用药、药物性肾损伤或者移植物相关问题都有关系，他们最了解叔叔之前的基础情况。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly and explicitly identified the high-risk transplant/immunosuppression, diabetes/insulin, and CKD/hyperkalemia context, and connected reddish urine to the need for renal/electrolyte evaluation and medication safety rather than simple hydration.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about urinary symptoms, fever, pain, and edema.",
          "quote": "你父亲现在除了尿色发红，有没有腰痛、发热、排尿不舒服或者下肢水肿？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor systematically assessed urine output, color, clots, fever, pain, weakness, palpitations/chest symptoms, mental status, and recent potassium/creatinine through targeted questions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00062",
          "explanation": "Doctor warns not to independently stop, skip, or change immunosuppressants or insulin.",
          "quote": "今晚抗排异药和胰岛素都可以照常吃，不要擅自停，突然停药会增加排斥风险，反而更危险。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly warned against self-stopping tacrolimus, mycophenolate mofetil, or insulin, directed physical verification of pill boxes, and instructed the family to bring all medications for clinician review.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
