          "explanation": "Doctor asks family to physically verify current pill boxes, injection pens, labels, and recent administration rather than relying on memory.",
          "quote": "药我只能先读盒子上的：有“他克莫司 1mg 胶囊”、还有“他克莫司 0.5mg 胶囊”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly asked for recent lab slips, discharge/follow-up instructions, medication labels, and actual dose timing, and used available workspace records when the patient account was insufficient. He also distinguished historical kidney fluctuations from the current episode.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00362",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigns concrete tasks: one person confirms symptoms/urine volume, one organizes medicines/lab records, one contacts transplant/nephrology follow-up or arranges testing.",
          "quote": "您就可以找现场医生确认，只要医生没说要停用，就按常规剂量给叔叔吃**他克莫司和吗替麦考酚酯**——之前只是要求抽药物浓度要在吃药前抽，抽完就可以正常吃药了，不用一直饿着肚子等，擅自停抗排异药反而有排斥风险。\n胰岛素可以先让护士测一下即时血糖，根据血糖结果和当天早饭的量，让护士或者医生给医嘱再打"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete executable plan with family tasks (one person confirming symptoms/urine output, one organizing medicines, one contacting follow-up), specified timing (emergency now for red flags, same-day testing if stable), stated materials to bring, and provided a fallback if the preferred plan failed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
