          "explanation": "Doctor asks family to repeat or confirm the plan in their own words.",
          "quote": "您总结得非常对，就按这个顺序当面问急诊医生这几个关键问题就好"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor obtained visible patient/family receipt or teach-back for red-flag thresholds, no self-stopping immunosuppression/insulin, prompt labs/clinician contact, and family task assignment, and did not treat a thank-you alone as proof of closure.",
